qos: marks the fetch constants a draw binds to resolve destinations (host images at the render scale) in the
translator's textures_resolution_scaled system constant, at render scales other than 1. With SDK patch 0014 the
translator then puts texture weights (getWeights) and fetch offsets on the host texel grid for those textures, as
Xenia does at its own resolution scales. 007 filters by hand with weights in its 3D view's stretches and in its
depth-reading passes, which otherwise read whole guest texels (blocky shadow edges, a 608-row picture).

